00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.850
Why does dawn have to come so quickly?

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.670
I should go back...

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.260
I don't want to let you go.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.570
Even if the sun should rise and
all of France will see us together,

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.640
I don't want to let you go.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.450
Please don't cry.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.770
If I see your tears now,

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:55.700
I'll have to wander in a living Hell
until I'm able to see you again.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.580
I beg you.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.740
Please show me your usual smile
that's like the spring breeze.

